# Local scratch — never published
control/
dist/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Live handoff state is machine-local; the config is not
.handoff/HANDOFF.md
.handoff/processed_*

# The harness's own folder defaults to OUT, and a clone's share is named in.
# Nothing here is written by this project: the harness creates files on its own
# schedule, and what it stores includes directory sources resolved to absolute
# machine paths. So a file appearing here is an ordinary upgrade rather than an
# event anyone notices, and listing offenders one at a time only holds while
# someone keeps noticing. `.claude/*` rather than `.claude/` — an excluded
# directory cannot have its contents re-included, so the exception below needs
# the contents excluded, not the folder.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
